{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Aromatherapy for everyday presence</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A gentle, practical approach to aromatherapy that may support mood, focus, and restful moments. Personalized blends and retail add-ons." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="blends.html">Blends</a>
        <a href="shop.html">Shop</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Pricing</a>
        <a href="about.html">Our Story</a>
        <a href="book.html">Schedule</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
      <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div>
          <h1>Restore a small sense of balance with scent</h1>
          <p class="lead">Discover approachable aromatherapy practices that may support calm, energy, or focus. No jargon—just practical scent tools you can use at home or on the go.</p>
          <p class="meta">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
          <p><a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="book.html">Book a consult</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-aside">
          <svg class="pattern" viewBox="0 0 200 200" aria-hidden="true">
            <defs>
              <pattern id="p" width="20" height="20" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                <rect width="10" height="10" fill="#f3efe8" />
                <rect x="10" y="10" width="10" height="10" fill="#f7f3ee" />
              </pattern>
            </defs>
            <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p)" />
          </svg>
          <div class="hero-card">
            <h3>Tailored scent kits</h3>
            <p>Small collections you can add to a session or keep for daily micro-practices.</p>
            <p class="muted">Retail add-ons available</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="diagnostic wrap" id="diagnostic">
      <h2>Find a scent direction</h2>
      <p class="intro">Choose a thread you'd like to explore—then try the simple practices or request a personalized blend.</p>
      <div class="diagnostic-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Grounded ease</h3>
          <p>For quieting a busy mind and coming back to breath.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Fresh focus</h3>
          <p>For clearer thinking during short bursts of work or study.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Gentle rest</h3>
          <p>For settling into evening routines and sleep-friendly moments.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="plan wrap" id="plan">
      <h2>How a session looks</h2>
      <ol class="process">
        <li><strong>Short intake:</strong> Tell us what you want to try and any safety notes (pregnancy, pets, meds).</li>
        <li><strong>A gentle demo:</strong> We explore single-note impressions and simple combinations.</li>
        <li><strong>Takeaway:</strong> A small kit or recipe you can use at home, plus dilution and patch-test guidance.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="safety">Safety-first: suggestions may support wellbeing but are not medical advice. Always patch-test and consult your provider for pregnancy or medication concerns.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="micro_habits wrap" id="micro_habits">
      <h2>Micro practices</h2>
      <p class="intro">Short scent habits, 1–3 minutes each, you can do between tasks.</p>
      <div class="habits">
        <div class="habit">
          <h4>Pause & inhale</h4>
          <p>Two slow inhales of a calming roll-on before a meeting.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="habit">
          <h4>Focus ping</h4>
          <p>A quick scent sniff on a card to prime attention for a task.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="habit">
          <h4>Evening unwind</h4>
          <p>A room mist sprayed once 30 minutes before sleep time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="aroma-wheel wrap" id="aroma-wheel">
      <h2>Interactive aroma wheel</h2>
      <p class="intro">Hover any note to read a brief description and see how notes layer across top, middle, and base.</p>
      <div class="wheel">
        <div class="wheel-center" id="wheel-center">Hover a note</div>
        <div class="wheel-ring top" aria-hidden="false">
          <h4>Top notes</h4>
          <ul>
            <li data-type="top" data-label="Citrus" data-desc="Bright, quick to announce; often perceived as fresh and uplifting.">Citrus</li>
            <li data-type="top" data-label="Herbaceous" data-desc="Green, brisk impressions that add clarity and lightness.">Herbaceous</li>
            <li data-type="top" data-label="Spicy-light" data-desc="Sparkling accents that bring a little heat and lift." >Spicy-light</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="wheel-ring middle">
          <h4>Middle notes</h4>
          <ul>
            <li data-type="middle" data-label="Floral" data-desc="Warm, often rounded notes that carry the character of a blend.">Floral</li>
            <li data-type="middle" data-label="Green" data-desc="Living, leafy tones that feel grounding but airy.">Green</li>
            <li data-type="middle" data-label="Spicy-deep" data-desc="Rich, warming heart notes that add body." >Spicy-deep</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="wheel-ring base">
          <h4>Base notes</h4>
          <ul>
            <li data-type="base" data-label="Resin" data-desc="Long-lasting anchors that add depth and persistence.">Resin</li>
            <li data-type="base" data-label="Woody" data-desc="Calm, dry tones that help blends linger on skin or fabrics.">Woody</li>
            <li data-type="base" data-label="Earthy" data-desc="Soft, grounding notes that feel stable and warm." >Earthy</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="proof wrap" id="proof">
      <h2>Proof gallery</h2>
      <p class="intro">Rotating testimonials and badges from partners and publications.</p>
      <div class="proof-grid">
        <div class="testimonials" id="testimonials" aria-live="polite">
          <blockquote class="quote current">"This blend quietly supports my evenings—nothing intense, just calmer breaths." — L.P.</blockquote>
          <blockquote class="quote">"Practical recommendations I could use right away. The roll-on is my new ritual." — M.R.</blockquote>
          <blockquote class="quote">"Thoughtful, safety-first guidance and lovely packaging." — S.T.</blockquote>
          <div class="controls">
            <button id="prev">◀</button>
            <button id="next">▶</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="badges">
          <div class="badge" data-tip="Featured in Local Wellness" tabindex="0">Local Press</div>
          <div class="badge" data-tip="Verified client reviews" tabindex="0">Verified</div>
          <div class="badge" data-tip="Partnered with small apothecaries" tabindex="0">Partner</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pricing wrap" id="pricing">
      <h2>Offerings & pricing</h2>
      <p class="intro">Simple packages—and retail add-ons so you can keep the practice at home.</p>
      <div class="pricing-grid">
        <div class="plan-card">
          <h3>Intro Session</h3>
          <p class="price">$65</p>
          <p>30-minute consult and a mini-sample kit. Ideal for first-timers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-card">
          <h3>Custom Blend Session</h3>
          <p class="price">$140</p>
          <p>60-minute session with a personalized recipe and a small takeaway bottle.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-card">
          <h3>At-home Support</h3>
          <p class="price">Retail add-on</p>
          <p>Scent kits and roll-ons you can purchase after any session.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="note">All suggestions are safety-oriented and may support wellbeing; not medical advice. See FAQ for dilution and patch testing.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="cta wrap" id="final-cta">
      <h2>Ready to try a focused scent practice?</h2>
      <p>Book a short consult or choose a curated kit to begin.</p>
      <p><a class="btn primary" href="book.html">Reserve time</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="shop.html">Explore kits</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="faq wrap" id="faq">
      <h2>FAQ & safety notes</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <div class="qa">
          <h4>Do these blends treat conditions?</h4>
          <p>No. Recommendations are not medical advice. Aromatherapy suggestions may support wellbeing but are not substitutes for medical care.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="qa">
          <h4>How should I dilute oils?</h4>
          <p>We provide dilution guidance with every recipe. Typical topical dilutions for adults are 1–3% for general use; always follow specific guidance and test a small patch first.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="qa">
          <h4>What about patch tests?</h4>
          <p>Apply a diluted sample to a small skin area and wait 24 hours. If irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a professional.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="qa">
          <h4>Pets & pregnancy</h4>
          <p>Some oils are not appropriate for pets or during pregnancy. Mention pets, pregnancy, breastfeeding, or medications during intake so we can tailor guidance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div>
        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
        <p>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a> • <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
